## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to translate CKNE into runtime gating for a serverless gateway, with multi-tenant fairness and SLA enforcement.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-resource mapping
- Degradation loop design
- Fairness, preemption, telemetry
- Minimal payload semantics

## Code Example
```javascript
function decideAllocations(ckneScores, totalConns) {
  // simple proportional mapping
  const ordered = Object.entries(ckneScores).sort((a,b)=> b[1]-a[1]);
  const alloc = {};
  let used = 0;
  for (const [t, ck] of ordered) {
    const take = Math.max(1, Math.round((ck) * totalConns));
    alloc[t] = Math.min(take, totalConns - used);
    used += alloc[t];
  }
  return alloc;
}
```

